237:Escalate to stronger operational artifacts when:
238-- document parity is no longer the live question and assembled prompt behavior must be replayed
239-- scenario lineage, run linkage, or replay execution state must stay inspectable across reruns
240-- the verdict depends on whether a replay actually executed rather than whether a benchmark question set exists
