242:Preferred operational artifacts:
243:- `Benchmark cohort manifest` when scenario identity and expected replay contract must be fixed before execution
244:- `Replay runner verdict sheet` when runner state, partial completion, or replay-attempted vs replay-complete distinction is the live issue
245-- `Replay suite verdict memo` when a higher-level suite verdict must summarize multiple runner-linked replay outcomes without hiding partial coverage
