247----
--
278-- bounded multi-view challenge -> `Debate / consensus comparison memo`
279-- prompt-stack rewrite or release audit -> `Prompt-stack release review`
280-- guide-chapter reflection or doc-to-runtime parity benchmark -> `Guide reflection benchmark memo`
281:- assembled prompt replay setup -> `Benchmark cohort manifest`
282:- assembled prompt replay runner-state verdict -> `Replay runner verdict sheet`
283-- assembled prompt replay suite summary -> `Replay suite verdict memo`
284-- governance-owned packet-floor audit or omission-sensitive review -> `Packet compliance report`
285-- versioned replay suite or benchmark cohort definition -> `Benchmark registry memo`
--
297-- engineering proof packet with executed-vs-unexecuted state -> `Coding proof bundle memo`
298-- integrated promotion packet with confidence class -> `Release evidence bundle v2`
299-- telemetry trend and cohort-aware drift review -> `Telemetry trend memo`
300:- benchmark cohort identity and run-linkage packet -> `Benchmark cohort manifest`
301:- replay execution-sheet and runner linkage packet -> `Replay runner verdict sheet`
302-- context substrate scoring packet -> `Context substrate scorecard`
303-- critique delta and no-gain logging packet -> `Critique delta ledger`
304-- adaptation controller audit packet -> `Adaptation controller audit packet`
