325-- Reasoning Techniques / Reflection -> `PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay`; prefer `Critique quality review memo` when critique utility or no-gain loops are under review
326-- Appendix A / advanced prompting execution families -> `PROMPT_search_reasoning_overlay` for decomposition, step-back, self-consistency, ReAct-like loops, tree-style search, and bounded reflection; keep prompt chaining in base prompts and treat example-catalog references as structure-only
327-- Guardrails / Safety -> `PROMPT_guardrails_safety_overlay`
328:- Evaluation / Monitoring -> `PROMPT_evaluation_monitoring_overlay` + `eval-ops`; prefer `Benchmark registry memo`, `Guide reflection benchmark memo`, or `Prompt-stack release review`
