162-Guide-reflection route rule:
163:- when the live question is whether to stay at document-level benchmark or escalate to assembled replay, this skill may compare the routes
164:- once the question becomes benchmark gating, replay execution state, or release-sensitive continuation, reroute final ownership to `eval-ops`
